OL,3,GNEWSAGas bills to increase by 5% from
OL,4,Anext month
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's gas supplier has announced a
OL,7,F5% increase in tariffs from December
OL,8,Fwhich it says is driven by rising
OL,9,Fwholesale energy costs.
OL,11,FGuernsey Energy said mains gas, mini
OL,12,Fbulk tank and cylinder tariffs would
OL,13,Fincrease by 1p per kilowatt hour for
OL,14,Fall domestic and commercial customers
OL,15,Ffrom 1 December.
OL,17,FThe increase comes less than eight
OL,18,Fmonths after it imposed a temporary
OL,19,F1.2p per kilowatt hour rise in April,
OL,20,Fciting turmoil in global gas markets.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
