OL,3,GNEWSAGas bills to increase by 5% from
OL,4,Anext month
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company said "global supply
OL,7,Fpressures, competition for available
OL,8,Fcargoes and disruption to Middle
OL,9,FEastern exports and shipping routes"
OL,10,Fhad increased its costs.
